# Security

- Password hashing: bcrypt rounds >= 10 (prefer 12+)
- Secrets must not be in code or committed `.env`; use CI/CD secrets or secret manager
- Enable security headers (`helmet`) and explicit CORS allowlist for public APIs
- Rate limit public endpoints (`@nestjs/throttler` or equivalent)
- Do not leak internal errors, stack traces, or DB messages to clients
- Add audit logging for sensitive actions (login, privilege changes, deletes)

